The '''Silver Coast''' is a stretch of coastline to the west of [[Gillijim's Isle]]. It is the longest shore of the island, leading to the southern coast and the [[Broken Reef]]. Along its shores is [[Faelon's Folly|a high elven shipwreck]] that had accompanied the [[Kul Tiran Exploratory Fleet]].

